PE 746: A Messy Medley / 杂乱混合

Exploring different metrics for N families (2 members each):

N=2 (2N=4, (4)!=24 permutations):
  Σ(adjacent families): 24
  Σ(families dist≤2):    40
  Σ(families dist>1):    24
  E[adj] * 24 = 24
  (Actually equals: 24)
N=3 (2N=6, (6)!=720 permutations):
  Σ(adjacent families): 720
  Σ(families dist≤2):    1296
  Σ(families dist>1):    1440
  E[adj] * 720 = 720
  (Actually equals: 720)
N=4 (2N=8, (8)!=40320 permutations):
  Σ(adjacent families): 40320
  Σ(families dist≤2):    74880
  Σ(families dist>1):    120960
  E[adj] * 40320 = 40320
  (Actually equals: 40320)

